I suspect that won't produce a save file compatible with the Symbian 
nethack. For the original symbian port, I always provided a version of 
recover which ran on a PC and which generated compatible sav files. I don't 
know whether it would still be compatible with the more recent symbian 
builds, but you could try the recover from my website and see what happens:

http://www.suttoncourtenay.org.uk/duncan/Downloads

You'll need to be able to run a DOS program though.


